nswer unverified by compile. Better use sim to preserve compile. Yet if sim succeeds, it's equivalent compile evidence, and we still need compile final. Use sim. If simulation fails compile, we used one of 3; still 2 sims + 1 compile. Fine.\n\nLet's call simulate with no_check before error.","sequence_number":4386}

